#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of ALSA Utilities"
msgstr "Instalação do ALSA Utilities"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:103
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>ALSA Utilities</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>ALSA Utilities</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --disable-alsaconf \\\n"
"            --disable-bat      \\\n"
"            --disable-xmlto    \\\n"
"            --with-curses=ncursesw &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --disable-alsaconf \\\n"
"            --disable-bat      \\\n"
"            --disable-xmlto    \\\n"
"            --with-curses=ncursesw &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>."
msgstr "Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>make check</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:126
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-alsaconf</parameter>: This switch disables building the"
" <command>alsaconf</command> configuration tool which is incompatible with "
"<application>Udev</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-alsaconf</parameter>: Essa chave desabilita construir a"
" ferramenta de configuração <command>alsaconf</command> que é incompatível "
"com o <application>Udev</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-xmlto</parameter>: Omit this switch if you have "
"installed <xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/> and wish to regenerate the man pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-xmlto</parameter>: Omita essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <xref linkend=\"xmlto\"/> e desejar regenerar as páginas de "
"manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:140
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-bat</parameter>: Omit this switch if you have installed"
" <xref linkend=\"fftw\"/> and wish to install the Basic Audio Tester (BAT)."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--disable-bat</parameter>: Omita essa chave se você tiver "
"instalado o <xref linkend=\"fftw\"/> e desejar instalar o Basic Audio Tester"
" (BAT)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:146
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-curses=ncursesw</parameter>: This switch forces the use of"
" wide-character ncurses libraries."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-curses=ncursesw</parameter>: Essa chave força o uso de "
"bibliotecas ncurses de caracteres largos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:153
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring ALSA Utilities"
msgstr "Configurando o ALSA Utilities"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/var/lib/alsa/asound.state</filename>"
msgstr "<filename>/var/lib/alsa/asound.state</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:163
#, xml-text
msgid "/var/lib/alsa/asound.state"
msgstr "/var/lib/alsa/asound.state"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:172
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As the &root; user, apply the default setting for the sound card.  Note that"
" this command may return an exit code of 99 although the card is correctly "
"initialized:"
msgstr ""
"Como o(a) usuário(a) &root;, aplique a configuração padrão para a placa de "
"som. Observe que este comando pode retornar um código de saída 99, embora a "
"placa esteja inicializada corretamente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:177
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>alsactl init</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>alsactl init</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Note that all channels of your sound card may be muted by default.  You can "
"use the <command>alsamixer</command> program to change this. Use "
"<command>speaker-test</command> to check that your settings have been "
"applied correctly. You should hear <quote>pink noise</quote> on your "
"speakers."
msgstr ""
"Observe que todos os canais da tua placa de som possivelmente estejam "
"silenciados por padrão. Você consegue usar o aplicativo "
"<command>alsamixer</command> para mudar isso. Use o <command>speaker-"
"test</command> para verificar se tuas configurações foram aplicadas "
"corretamente. Você deveria ouvir <quote>ruído rosa</quote> nos teus alto-"
"falantes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:188
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename>alsactl</filename> program is normally run from a standard "
"<application>udev</application> rule. The first time it is run, it will "
"complain that there is no state in "
"<filename>/var/lib/alsa/asound.state</filename>. You can prevent this by "
"running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"O aplicativo <filename>alsactl</filename> normalmente é executado a partir "
"de uma regra padrão do <application>udev</application>. Na primeira vez que "
"for executado, ele reclamará que não existe estado em "
"<filename>/var/lib/alsa/asound.state</filename>. Você pode evitar isso "
"executando o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:196
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>alsactl -L store</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>alsactl -L store</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The volume settings should be restored from the saved state by "
"<application>Udev</application> when the device is detected (during boot or "
"when plugged in for USB devices)."
msgstr ""
"As configurações de volume deveriam ser restauradas a partir do estado salvo"
" pelo <application>Udev</application> quando o dispositivo for detectado "
"(durante a inicialização ou quando plugado para dispositivos USB)."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"On systems which have multiple sound cards, you may need to adjust the "
"default audio device so that you can get output from your speakers.  To set "
"the default device, first check the <filename>/proc/asound/cards</filename> "
"file to determine which number you need to set. After you know this "
"information, set the default card with the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Em sistemas que tem múltiplas placas de som, você possivelmente necessite "
"ajustar o dispositivo de áudio padrão, de forma que possa obter saída a "
"partir dos teus alto-falantes. Para configurar o dispositivo padrão, "
"primeiro verifique o arquivo <filename>/proc/asound/cards</filename> para "
"determinar qual número precisa configurar. Depois que souber essas "
"informações, configure a placa padrão com o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:214
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/asound.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/asound.conf\n"
"\n"
"defaults.pcm.card 1\n"
"defaults.ctl.card 1\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/asound.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/asound.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal># Inicia /etc/asound.conf\n"
"\n"
"defaults.pcm.card 1\n"
"defaults.ctl.card 1\n"
"\n"
"# Termina /etc/asound.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:226
#, xml-text
msgid "Boot Script"
msgstr "Conjunto de Comandos Sequenciais de Inicialização"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid "alsa"
msgstr "alsa"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:233
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To automatically store and restore volume settings (if the udev rule doesn't"
" work for you) when the system is rebooted, install the "
"<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/alsa</filename> boot script from the <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\" "
"revision=\"systemd\"/> package."
msgstr ""
"Para armazenar e restaurar automaticamente as configurações de volume (se a "
"regra do Udev não funcionar para você) quando o sistema for reinicializado, "
"instale o conjunto de comandos sequenciais de inicialização "
"<filename>/etc/rc.d/init.d/alsa</filename> a partir do pacote <xref "
"linkend=\"bootscripts\" revision=\"sysv\"/> <xref linkend=\"systemd-units\" "
"revision=\"systemd\"/>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/multimedia/libdriv/alsa-utils.xml:240
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install-alsa</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make install-alsa</userinput>"

